# The Temple of Uggalepih: the three exits. Entered at area 1 each time; _4j2, _4j3 and _4j4 each play
# 32003: option 0 stays, option 4 leaves the fight (0x075). After the first exit the next tick still adds
# the battlefield effect (254) and moves the char into the arena; the warp back removes it. After the
# second exit the tick shows nothing.
lists SacrificialChamber/_4j0/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/onEventUpdate/32000 SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32000 SacrificialChamber/_4j2/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/_4j3/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/_4j4/onTrigger SacrificialChamber/onEventFinish/32003
char zone=SacrificialChamber pos=299,0.1,349 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Zilart TheTempleOfUggalepih current
keyitem SacrificialChamberKey
login
trigger _4j0
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger _4j2
finish option=0                         # stays
trigger _4j2
finish option=4                         # out (0x075)
tick 2000
warp 299,0.1,349 SacrificialChamber
trigger _4j0
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger _4j3
finish option=4                         # out
tick 2000
warp 299,0.1,349 SacrificialChamber
trigger _4j0
update 32000 option=1
finish
trigger _4j4
finish option=4                         # out
